state. What does that mean? Well, it means&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:39.840 --> 00:00:44.480
if you make abortion more difficult&nbsp;
to obtain or you make it illegal,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:44.480 --> 00:00:50.160
