will either go to a neighboring state if they&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:50.160 --> 00:00:57.040
can afford it and if it's legal in a neighboring&nbsp;
state or they will pay for an illegal abortion.

00:00:57.040 --> 00:01:00.720
This is very common in other countries. I&nbsp;
mean, if you if you look at where I was born&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:01:00.720 --> 00:01:05.040
Argentina, there were long periods of time&nbsp;
where it was illegal. But if you had money,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:01:05.040 --> 00:01:10.080
