and you had the money to do it. That's the second&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:01:10.080 --> 00:01:17.040
option. Third option what we sometimes call a back&nbsp;
alley abortion, a home abortion. In this case,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:01:17.040 --> 00:01:22.480
it's being called a self-induced abortion.&nbsp;
And that is exactly what happened here,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:01:22.480 --> 00:01:29.200
